    "sections": {
        "description": "The Bridal Store WordPress Theme is a gracefully crafted and intuitive template designed for bridal boutiques, wedding planners, and wedding-related service providers. Its elegant, fully responsive layout is ideal for showcasing bridal gowns, accessories, bridesmaid dresses, and groom’s wear with style and sophistication. Perfect for businesses offering wedding planning, photography, makeup, catering, or destination weddings, this theme makes online presentation seamless. With built-in WooCommerce integration, you can easily set up an online store or service catalog. The theme emphasizes visual storytelling with features like full-width banners, image carousels, video backgrounds, and client testimonials—creating a romantic and immersive experience for every visitor. Flexible layout options let you highlight venues, inspiration boards, hair and makeup services, florals, and entertainment with ease. Whether you're launching a vendor directory, a wedding blog, or a save-the-date landing page, this theme offers all the tools you need to create a beautiful, engaging, and conversion-friendly website."
    },
